Section: 4.3. Discussion
Text: Of the linguistic features, POS tags improved the perfor- mance of the Linear SVM marginally in terms of recall for the Offensive class, other classiﬁers deteriorated in their performance.It is not yet clear whether this is due to the ac- curacy of the Greek model available for spaCy in producing such tags or the tags themselves as features and is a subject that can be explored with further improvements of spaCy or other NLP tools developed for Greek.

