Section: 4. Methods
Text: For the last deep learning architecture we wanted to use a BERT (Devlin et al., 2019) model trained on Greek. However there was no BERT model available for Greek language. The model that came closest our requirement was multilingual BERT model 4 trained on 108 languages (Devlin et al., 2019) in- cluding Greek. Since training BERT is a very computation- aly expensive task we used the available multilingual BERT cased model for the sixth deep learning architecture.

Rank: 15
